The product: Multi-Grade PE Grade-Transition Optimization
Polyethylene grade-transition optimization for polymer plants: cuts off-spec =
material and transition time during grade changes.

Our match review points to Multi-Grade PE Grade-Transition Optimization as th=
e strongest overlap with your focus: Polyethylene grade-transition optimizati=
on fits chemicals and industrial deployment. Provisional focus fit, not inves=
tment readiness or eligibility confirmation.

Maturity: validated prototype (TRL 4-5); the first real-data pilot on a partn=
er site is the agreed next milestone, and we would value exactly this convers=
ation with you.

A professional pitch deck is attached (Khalij-AryaSasol-MultiGrade-PE-Transit=
